---
Add dark/light theme toggle.

Allow switching between dark and light color themes for the entire GUI.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Dark theme (current default) and light theme available
- [ ] Toggle button or menu option to switch
- [ ] All GUI elements (toolbar, grid, panels, editors) respect theme
- [ ] Theme preference saved to config/project
- [ ] Nuklear style colors updated atomically (no partial theme)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Toggle to light theme, verify all panels use light colors
- [ ] Toggle back to dark, verify restoration
- [ ] Verify text readable in both themes
- [ ] Save and reload, verify theme persists
